      "page": "details",
      "excerpt": "Digital Innovation & Entrepreneurship // 28DIGITAL 28Digital Digital Innovation & Entrepreneurship Discover opportunities to build and launch with us the next generation of digital ventures, products and services. Home Digital Innovation & Entrepreneurship Check out the current opportunities in 28DIGITAL's ecosystem! Programmes, initiatives, services and EU-funded projects are waiting for you. Find out more Mentor Me Program Unlock the potential of your startup with the exclusive initiative designed to empower early-stage entrepreneurs through expert mentorship. Find out more Speedmaster An Intense Course Package for Entrepreneurs Find out more Venture Incubation Program From Idea to First Customers Find out more Open Innovation Factory From Product-Market Fit to Scalable Revenue Find out more Access to Finance Prepare, Connect and Raise Your Series A/B Funding Round Find out more Equity Portfolio View growth companies in which we hold shares resulting from the Open Innovation Factory & Venture Program. Find out more Champions The European Scaleup Competition Find out more Initiated by the European Institute of Innovation and Technology (EIT) ©2010-2026 28Digital · Legal Notice · Intranet · Contact Us · For Press · Reporting Channel Scroll up Initiated by the EIT Our Community Purpose Become a Partner About us Why 28D? Mission & Vision Strategy 2026-2030 History Supervisory"
