      "url": "https://28digital.eu/venture-incubation-program/",
      "page": "details",
      "excerpt": "Venture Incubation Program // 28DIGITAL 28Digital Venture Incubation Program Do you want to start your entrepreneurial journey? Do you have a business idea and want to turn your innovative digital technology into an MVP and start your venture? Home Venture Incubation Program What is the 28DIGITAL Venture Incubation Program? The 28DIGITAL Venture Incubation Program is a two-stage initiative supporting the creation and growth of digital and deep-tech ventures (including projects and spin-offs originating from the universities, research organisation, and academic laboratories seeking to realise the commercial potential of their innovation) across Europe. The program helps teams to: validate a business idea and shape an MVP strengthen entrepreneurial and venture-building skills incorporate a company in the EU prepare for market entry, investment, and growth Program structure Stage 1: Growth Package Introductory bootcamp followed by a 12-week incubation program including mentoring, MVP development, and validation, concluding in Demo Day. Selected teams receive a €5,000 Growth Package Prize. Stage 2: Final Prize Selected ventures may apply for the final stage and compete for up to €25,000 based on performance. Important: Selected ventures will commit to providing 28DIGITAL with 5% equity through a SAFE (Simple Agreement for Future Equity). Who can apply? The 28DIGITAL Venture"
