      "url": "https://workspaces.28digital.eu/site/private/go/article.aspx?id=614",
      "page": "details",
      "excerpt": "Co-Creation Accelerator 2026-2027 – Proposals Submission - 28Digital / CO-CREATION ACCELERATOR 2026-2027 – PROPOSALS SUBMISSION Co-Creation Accelerator 2026-2027 - Proposals Submission Co-Creation Accelerator 2026-2027 Call for Proposals Document Co-Creation Accelerator 2026-2027 Proposal Submission System Open Challenge Track Challenge Definition Template 28DIGITAL Launches a call for proposals for the Co-Creation Accelerator 2026-2027. We are looking for world-Class digital solutions developed by ventures ranging from early-stage to more mature teams who are looking to validate their digital products and achieve early traction at corporates and/or SMEs as pilot customers or partners. Two complementary tracks are possible: Industry Challenge Track and Open Challenge Track. We are accepting Industry Track challenges on a rolling basis. These Industry challenges will be published here. Please stay tuned for updates. Please refer to Co-Creation Aceelerator Call 2026-2027 for Proposals Document for further details. Current Partners as well as new organizations willing to join 28DIGITAL are welcome to submit a proposal. This page contains information and relevant documents for Partners planning to submit a proposal for the 2026 edition of Co-Creation Accelerator . Timeline Call opening date: 01 July 2026 . Submission deadline : 08 September 2026 at 17:00 CEST (hard deadline, no"
