      "id": "check-page-a0168fce96",
      "url": "https://28digital.eu/alumni-startup-competition/",
      "page": "portfolio",
      "excerpt": "Alumni Startup Competition // 28DIGITAL 28Digital Alumni Startup Competition The competition for the 28DIGITAL Alumni-founded startups Home Alumni Startup Competition Your startup deserves a bigger room. Alumni Startup Competition is the first startup competition built by 28DIGITAL, for the 28DIGITAL Alumni community. Pitch your startup to a room of investors, European stakeholders and fellow Alumni. Get visibility, feedback, and a shot at exclusive prizes. Open to all 28DIGITAL Alumni founders. Any stage, any sector, anywhere. Four steps. One winner. Apply - before 7 September Apply before 7 September 2026. One form. Ten Minutes. Apply Here's everything you need to know before you start. Who can apply? The competition is open to applicants who meet both of the following criteria: You are currently enrolled in, or have completed, the EIT Digital Master School or Doctoral School (DSL or iDSL). You are a founder of an incorporated startup, or plan to incorporate within the next few months. In the latter case, if you win, the prize money will be awarded to the company upon incorporation with the appropriate documentation requested. Deadline Applications close on 7 September 2026, 23:59 CEST . We recommend submitting your application early. Our selection committee reviews applications on a rolling basis and may contact you with follow-up questions. What do you get? All eligible"
